{"server":"tw","storyId":"act21side_level_act21side_05_end","groupId":"act21side","stageId":"act21side_05","title":"恆久法則","storyCode":"IS-5","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act21side/level_act21side_05_end.txt","sourceHash":"b4c00f1ac542549971ce977e119952192a4a908e066279069a27b55d2c889aa6","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g1_srcstreet"},{"type":"narration","text":"薩盧佐家族周邊"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萊昂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我向來不會對你的做法指指點點，我希望你能對諸事有自己的判斷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些年，你做得很好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你真的這麼想，又為什麼......"},{"type":"narration","text":"為什麼要在這時突然出手？\n為什麼要告訴我那些？\n為什麼要......背叛拉維妮婭？\n萊昂圖索心中有無數疑問，卻發現自己一個都問不出口。\n之前的所見所聞顛覆了他的認知，他忽然覺得，眼前的父親是陌生的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因為，現在是最好的，也是唯一的機會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是什麼意思？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你會知道的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"貝納爾多先生，萊昂圖索先生，恭候多時了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？你不是薩盧佐的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"食品安全部部長，盧比奧。為什麼你會......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今晚的宴會，將由食品安全部提供食材，並由鄙人親自下廚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我聽說過，在沃爾西尼，想要舉辦一場上好的宴會，離不開食品安全部的支持。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您過譽了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是希望能提供讓每個家族的貴人們都滿意的食物罷了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然如此，今晚的宴會，倒是更讓人期待了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g5_srcpark"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他現在在哪裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他去了薩盧佐家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不問為什麼嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我能感覺到，貝納爾多對你來說，很重要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在我當上了這座城市的法官之後，他沒有要求我必須像別的法官那樣，在立場上維護自己背後的家族。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他允許我做我自己想做的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有萊昂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萊昂作為貝洛內家族在這座城市的領導者，他也願意尊重我的工作，以及我所堅持的公正。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"即便我將矛頭指向貝洛內，他也會公事公辦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"用他的話說，就是我的公正比單純的暴力更有效率。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不討厭他這種對於公正的理解，他甚至也會閒暇時讀一讀法律相關的書籍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但即便如此，身為法官，我依然要面對這座城市中時刻在發生的不公。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"家族之間的傾軋，家族對普通市民的壓迫，普通市民的敢怒不敢言......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我越是想要公正行事，就越意識到自己舉步維艱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我曾經安慰自己，起碼並沒有成為家族的幫兇，德克薩斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼可能呢，我的手早就髒了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是我還不想承認，髒才是理所當然的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"即使這在你看來可能是可笑的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"貝納爾多對我的許諾，是我能夠在敘拉古堅持擔任法官的唯一理由。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"許諾？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......他曾經對我說，等到貝洛內家族取得勝利的那一天，他會在敘拉古開闢出一片地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在那裡，我所相信的律法將不再依託於單純的權力，我所想要的公平能夠真正實現。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以在那之前，他希望我能夠忍耐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"每當我堅持不下去的時候，我就會想到他的承諾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你說，如果這真的只是一個謊言，那我過去十幾年的生活又算是什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我想，以他的立場和地位，他沒有必要說這種謊言。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊。所以——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩盧佐家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩盧佐家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？你是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是法官拉維妮婭，關於謀殺卡拉奇的罪犯，我有問題想要找阿爾貝托閣下談談。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩盧佐家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"法官閣下......老爺正在宴請貴客，沒有時間......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"貴客，是指貝納爾多·貝洛內，是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩盧佐家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請轉告兩位領袖，茲事體大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今天，如果見不到兩位，我是不會回去的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g7_reception"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這道菜，是我從一位萊塔尼亞廚師那裡學來的，請諸位品嚐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不錯，不錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"時代真是跟過去不一樣了啊，貝納爾多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"過去，我們想要一樣東西，只會想，我一定要得到它，誰攔著我，我就殺了誰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我要找幾個和我關係好的官員，或者商人，讓他們替我去拿，事情還不能太聲張，免得被人發現。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多可笑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你說對吧，盧比奧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這......是您的，總是您的，能替您取東西，也是那些人的運氣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"盧比奧部長能站在這裡，想必運氣也不錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我恰是沒有那樣的運氣，才會選了這樣的方法，也不過是一介想要博大佬們歡心的小丑罷了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，你這老小子，也是喜歡妄自菲薄，你能站在這裡，足以證明你的價值了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您說的是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，貝納爾多，場面話說了這麼多，我們也該說點真心話了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你想動那一位，做十二家族一直想做卻不敢做的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可以，我奉陪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，水雖然已經攪渾了，想讓那位下場，可遠遠不夠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你既然敢來赴宴，就說明，現在的局勢還在你的掌控中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說吧，你到底想怎麼做？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿爾貝托，你怎麼看羅塞蒂家族？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"羅塞蒂？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個家族，野心不小。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，羅塞蒂家族能走到今天，可不是單單因為喬萬娜自稱是薩爾瓦多雷的接班人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或許有人真的以為德克薩斯這個姓氏留下的遺產——老薩爾瓦多雷的凝聚力，是一筆了不起的財富。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但在我看來，那根本就是一種負擔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人格魅力，人格魅力，歸根結底不過是錢到位了，別人才願意正眼看你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對，也不對。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"坐在你我這個位置上，總得有些服人的手段。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"平心而論，我倒確實有些佩服喬萬娜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對她而言，德克薩斯的遺產無疑是一種負擔，但她不僅挑起了這個負擔，而且確實把它變成了自己的東西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"誠然，羅塞蒂走到今天，靠的是羅塞蒂自己積累的財力和人脈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但他們走得有些過頭了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼說？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你當真覺得，那位想把新的城市交給我們之中任何一個家族？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們這些家族在這座城市裡互相爭奪至今，羅塞蒂都沒有表現出絲毫參與的動靜，彷彿他們真的與世無爭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但他們可是接過了薩爾瓦多雷遺產的羅塞蒂，他們將建設城市的技術交給敘拉古，難道就當真沒有一點想法？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對一座為了紀念薩爾瓦多雷而建造的新城市？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且是一座足以改變敘拉古未來格局的新城市？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不妨說得再清楚一點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我說得再清楚不過了，阿爾貝托。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"十二家族在這座城市裡撕咬至今，對那位來說，不過是一場鬥獸的好戲罷了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"忠誠的家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老爺......（耳語）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？拉維妮婭法官，還有那個切利尼娜？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她們想要見我和貝納爾多？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"貝納爾多，這是什麼意思？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她們不是我帶來的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薩盧佐對於客人，向來是歡迎的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但不是客人的——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"按薩盧佐的規矩來辦就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵呵，既然如此，聽到了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"忠誠的家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"貝納爾多，我知道你喜歡和人聊一些局勢、一些規劃、一些未來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我這個人，卻更喜歡聽一些更加實幹的東西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因為你對這些東西早已爛熟於胸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人們只記得薩盧佐絕不輕易下注，卻幾乎都要忘了，薩盧佐絕不輕易鬆口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"盧比奧，接下來沒有你的事了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"盧比奧部長，對歌舞劇感興趣嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這......空閒的時候，我也會去看一看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣的話，倒是正好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"收下吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這......是《德克薩斯之死》第二幕的票？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對，如果你感興趣，可以去看一看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"貝納爾多，我說過，客套話已經結束了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也想邀請薩盧佐的諸位，一起前往觀劇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你說什麼？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g11_mansionhall"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"忠誠的家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請回吧，兩位。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"忠誠的家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們並不在今天的邀請之列。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我說，我今天非見不可呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"忠誠的家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薩盧佐對於不受歡迎的客人，也有相應的待客之道。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......切利尼娜，抱歉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我就是為此而來的，不是嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"忠誠的家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......對薩盧佐刀劍相向，你瘋了嗎？切利尼娜，最後的德克薩斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"恰恰相反。"},{"type":"narration","text":"不以殺戮為目的，而是為了一個正直的、真切的願望出手，這會是回到敘拉古以來，最讓她不覺得空虛的一次戰鬥。\n德克薩斯如此想道。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g7_reception"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的劇場經理告訴我，羅塞蒂家族預約了明晚那場演出的貴賓包廂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵呵，在劇院裡動手，這就是白日劇團著名的藝術總監的做法嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過是在一齣戲劇中加入一些名為真實的佐料罷了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，有一點，我還是有些疑慮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喬萬娜的手下，也聚集了來自哥倫比亞的好手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"尤其是他們在這座城市的代理領袖，瓦拉赫，他的凶名我也有所耳聞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你憑什麼斷定，你我聯手，就能拿下她？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激進的家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"首領......（耳語）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，這可真是有意思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"貝納爾多，那位法官和那個德克薩斯，看來，很想見你啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的手下，已經被她們傷了好幾個了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這兩位，都是與你貝洛內有淵源的人物，這有些說不過去吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薩盧佐的家族成員，素來以嗜血好鬥聞名。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿爾貝托，如果羅塞蒂派人來攻打你的這座家族宅邸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你覺得他們有幾分勝算？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們絕無勝算。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"切利尼娜會是一柄刺穿羅塞蒂的利刃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果羅塞蒂的人進不來的地方，切利尼娜進得來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，你又何須擔心，羅塞蒂能夠攔得住她？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g11_mansionhall"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我記得你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"忠誠的家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還以為你不會承認你在這裡生活過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在薩盧佐時的生活還不壞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"忠誠的家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你就更應該知道，你正在做什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"德克薩斯，你......"},{"type":"narration","text":"看著周圍昏迷的家族成員，拉維妮婭不禁一時失語。\n在這種情況下，德克薩斯居然還做到了留手，即使和家族打了這麼久的交道，這依然有些超出了她的認知。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"幸好你不是我的敵人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，看起來，我們也只能到此為止了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萊昂？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......拉維妮婭，你不該來的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有些話，我必須當面問貝納爾多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"針對羅塞蒂家族領袖的刺殺已經決定了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薩盧佐和貝洛內會聯手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這就是他的決定？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這就是貝洛內的決定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他在哪？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"宴會剛剛結束，父親還在樓上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你可以去見他，但什麼都不會改變。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一路上，拉維妮婭思考了千萬種開口的方式。\n她有太多的問題想要質問貝納爾多。\n她設想過無數種與貝納爾多爭吵的方式，以及結果。\n她以為自己足夠憤怒。\n然而，當她踏入房間時，卻被眼前的一幕震懾。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"貝納爾多端坐在華貴的椅子上。\n他捧著一本裝飾著荊棘的法典。\n與她手中的那本如出一轍。\n他低著頭，手掌輕輕摩挲著法典，彷彿完全沒有注意到——他的雙手拂過尖刺，而鮮血緩緩流出。\n紛亂的思緒在此時凝固。\n最終，千言萬語凝聚成了一句話——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"遊戲結束了，拉維妮婭。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"只這一句，對於拉維妮婭來說，已經足夠。\n僅僅是幾秒鐘的沉默，卻耗盡了她所有的力氣。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"拉維妮婭轉身離開，沒有回頭，生怕眼淚奪眶而出。\n貝納爾多留在原地，不發一言，幾顆血珠滴落地面。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
